\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Object of my first desire,
\par Jesus, crucified for me;
\par All to happiness aspire,
\par Only to be found in Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thee to praise, and Thee to know,
\par Constitute my bliss below;
\par Thee to see, and Thee to love,
\par Constitute my bliss above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, it is not life to live,
\par If Thy presence Thou deny;
\par Lord, if Thou Thy presence give,
\par 'Tis no longer death to die.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Source and giver of repose,
\par Only from Thy smile it flows,
\par Peace and happiness are Thine;
\par Mine they are, if Thou art mine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Let me but Thyself possess-
\par Total sum of happiness-
\par Real bliss I then shall prove,
\par Heaven below and heaven above.
\par                                             Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

